WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.043
Hello. I would like two apples and bread.

00:00:04.293 --> 00:00:07.553
Do you want this bread or this bread roll?

00:00:07.803 --> 00:00:09.673
This bread, please.

00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:11.767
Do you need a bag?

00:00:12.017 --> 00:00:15.200
No, thank you. I have my bag.
